  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "85e7c36c-4e89-cf8b-c54d-befb281911f9",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"text-size-2-copy\">Let’s talk matcha, from R&amp;D samples to high-volume production</p>",
    "text": "Let’s talk matcha, from R&D samples to high-volume production"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "85e7c36c-4e89-cf8b-c54d-befb281911fb",
   "text": {
    "html": "<a class=\"button-10\" data-wf-link-page-id=\"6798bd1e4b234bad93cdab33\">Need matcha at scale?</a>",
    "text": "Need matcha at scale?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "component-instance",
   "id": "390e49a3-d2fe-b758-b04b-5fe3805029d4",
   "componentId": "1a834969-357f-5874-547c-66ae3d92c40d",
   "propertyOverrides": []
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c25",
   "text": {
    "html": "<h2 class=\"pricing-h1 faq-h2\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>",
    "text": "Frequently Asked Questions"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c2c",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"faq-q-text\">What is your minimum order quantity (MOQ) for bulk matcha powder?</div>",
    "text": "What is your minimum order quantity (MOQ) for bulk matcha powder?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c2f",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"faq-answer-text\">Our bulk matcha supply programs typically start from <strong data-w-id=\"719dbfa0-9191-8ff1-af76-6546ecaab206\">5 kg per order</strong>, depending on grade and certification requirements. We work with growing brands, manufacturers, and distributors to structure scalable supply agreements that align with production planning.<br data-w-id=\"72d45b45-3ec7-52da-e430-e95fee87b32f\"><br data-w-id=\"bebe6cd6-1a45-a2e0-e8cb-537dc849e8a0\">For higher-volume buyers, pallet-scale and annual contract options are available (volumes go up to over 100.000kg + per year).</p>",
    "text": "Our bulk matcha supply programs typically start from 5 kg per order, depending on grade and certification requirements. We work with growing brands, manufacturers, and distributors to structure scalable supply agreements that align with production planning.\n\nFor higher-volume buyers, pallet-scale and annual contract options are available (volumes go up to over 100.000kg + per year)."
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c36",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"faq-q-text\"><strong data-w-id=\"02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c37\">Do you supply organic wholesale matcha?</strong></div>",
    "text": "Do you supply organic wholesale matcha?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c3a",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"faq-answer-text\">Yes. We offer <strong data-w-id=\"ddb0e6c5-bd31-d07a-765a-4cef3fe2f232\">USDA Organic, EU Organic, and JAS-certified matcha</strong> suitable for supplement brands, beverage manufacturers, and private label programs.<br data-w-id=\"61cb1333-b605-c8ff-2246-1d56fa1559e9\"><br data-w-id=\"a08929c3-eb88-3453-d76d-179eac2a51a2\">All organic batches include:<br data-w-id=\"28131f6a-6368-3673-f3df-8a4724ac982e\">- Valid certification documentation<br data-w-id=\"11ec4064-3219-723d-8ce9-35ad5667545a\">- Certificate of Analysis (COA)<br data-w-id=\"0e41a770-6f1e-b9c8-2f6a-a6706d845c4d\">- Full traceability records</p>",
    "text": "Yes. We offer USDA Organic, EU Organic, and JAS-certified matcha suitable for supplement brands, beverage manufacturers, and private label programs.\n\nAll organic batches include:\n- Valid certification documentation\n- Certificate of Analysis (COA)\n- Full traceability records"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c41",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"faq-q-text\"><strong data-w-id=\"a1876ad2-e302-c8b9-220a-0d8a8e42730d\">Is your bulk matcha powder lab-tested?</strong></div>",
    "text": "Is your bulk matcha powder lab-tested?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c44",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"faq-answer-text\">Yes. Every batch is independently tested for:<br data-w-id=\"3f2edb7a-6eb8-3328-6671-06e2e687668f\"><br data-w-id=\"cee1b3f6-cfc0-eb55-42f4-1b985684a0d4\">- Heavy metals<br data-w-id=\"cdf224e3-40f4-52fd-bd7a-8baaffb44f6e\">- Pesticide residues<br data-w-id=\"dae21511-2c13-a508-d6a0-fe4fe7c322f1\">- Microbiological safety<br data-w-id=\"16a0a5de-8d7e-1366-04f3-ee795cbcd702\">- Radiation (upon request)<br data-w-id=\"d12df6a5-c84d-9047-1487-58c4c53f9ea2\"><br data-w-id=\"cc80d09c-7d11-09eb-fd3f-d8a17eee39f4\">We provide COAs and technical specification sheets for regulatory and import compliance.</p>",
    "text": "Yes. Every batch is independently tested for:\n\n- Heavy metals\n- Pesticide residues\n- Microbiological safety\n- Radiation (upon request)\n\nWe provide COAs and technical specification sheets for regulatory and import compliance."
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c51",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"faq-q-text\"><strong data-w-id=\"1c30d662-92bf-4e4f-944d-31563ae474e3\">Do you supply matcha for supplement and capsule manufacturing?</strong></div>",
    "text": "Do you supply matcha for supplement and capsule manufacturing?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c54",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"faq-answer-text\">Yes. We provide <strong data-w-id=\"f4f9cce3-4965-6e1b-37e9-017098b45e9d\">ingredient-grade matcha powder suitable for encapsulation, powder blends, and nutraceutical formulations</strong>.<br data-w-id=\"18c292bf-90f7-b6ce-5e89-3824d52a759e\"><br data-w-id=\"edcda6d2-dc51-20ce-639b-594232b9c4bd\">Our matcha offers:<br data-w-id=\"b49f0516-ee2b-093d-0556-e5ea2ab9cbc7\">- Fine particle size for capsule filling<br data-w-id=\"d1bd17f7-8fc3-8cab-6c04-797e52fc60bc\">- Stable caffeine levels<br data-w-id=\"1b21c576-9ae2-b4e7-1034-d3a63d2a261c\">- Consistent catechin (EGCG) profile<br data-w-id=\"4dd46608-6214-e99c-1dcb-3e835d9aa34f\">- Clean-label positioning</p>",
    "text": "Yes. We provide ingredient-grade matcha powder suitable for encapsulation, powder blends, and nutraceutical formulations.\n\nOur matcha offers:\n- Fine particle size for capsule filling\n- Stable caffeine levels\n- Consistent catechin (EGCG) profile\n- Clean-label positioning"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c5e",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"faq-q-text\"><strong data-w-id=\"b1c98fda-0a4e-4cbf-b039-5b8a962765b1\">Can you ship bulk matcha to the USA and UK?</strong></div>",
    "text": "Can you ship bulk matcha to the USA and UK?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c61",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"faq-answer-text\">Yes. We regularly supply bulk matcha powder to:<br data-w-id=\"df6a4713-d85f-eccd-782c-e5eb840fb7e6\"><br data-w-id=\"483061de-c0db-52cf-4c8c-9de3eb7e6b7e\">- <a data-wf-link-page-id=\"6991ff8c153af5609e330dad\" data-w-id=\"78cc54c6-dd87-7ae1-eacc-9f626fffe88b\">United States</a><br data-w-id=\"41e0d159-b0df-5b91-a111-8c385dec5c1b\">- United Kingdom<br data-w-id=\"1a5988df-5fa9-5ea2-c1ab-8997967ccd28\">- Europe<br data-w-id=\"038b7854-631b-e3df-b1ff-e9f0532417ce\">- Middle East<br data-w-id=\"33c3f150-a483-cbaa-2ffb-5cc53b013a6a\">- International export markets<br data-w-id=\"1a6064ff-a7c1-00d3-9557-5123b730f75a\"><br data-w-id=\"2d179cd7-de21-7935-4612-04ee3a62439e\">We provide full export documentation and support import compliance requirements.</p>",
    "text": "Yes. We regularly supply bulk matcha powder to:\n\n- United States\n- United Kingdom\n- Europe\n- Middle East\n- International export markets\n\nWe provide full export documentation and support import compliance requirements."
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "bf2bedc4-b2b1-774f-4990-286387356861",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"faq-q-text\"><strong data-w-id=\"bf2bedc4-b2b1-774f-4990-286387356862\">What matcha grades are available for wholesale supply?</strong></div>",
    "text": "What matcha grades are available for wholesale supply?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "bf2bedc4-b2b1-774f-4990-286387356865",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"faq-answer-text\">We supply multiple bulk matcha grades, including:<br data-w-id=\"22c77ecd-c3f8-c6dc-5191-d5735305e1e7\">‍<br data-w-id=\"477de593-c5cd-7ec3-9e3b-c6e9efc92927\">- <a data-wf-link-page-id=\"67ffa2b15258e1b4236839cb\" data-w-id=\"b791ecb5-7f8e-bc8b-2ead-d7de1ae86980\">Ceremonial Matcha</a> (premium beverage applications)<br data-w-id=\"c876d303-6979-af29-f458-df8faec90ec4\">- <a data-wf-link-page-id=\"67ffaa8d537bb69e01067ea2\" data-w-id=\"cf0bb9c7-a618-b234-37ab-ad0d46e7916b\">Premium Matcha</a> (daily latte use)<br data-w-id=\"783e2828-444c-4089-053a-c48bd6f7f323\">- <a data-wf-link-page-id=\"67ffaac17dc60f8b48708801\" data-w-id=\"d122e2ec-22a9-a213-1d76-9703515f4556\">Culinary Matcha</a> (high-volume food &amp; beverage production)<br data-w-id=\"8a1723e8-45b3-b777-fdac-500dda7c4e4f\">- <a data-wf-link-page-id=\"698ec0496e41b2e15740e98f\" data-w-id=\"1ecb6b72-4b97-7238-3cc7-f4cd3788969c\">Ingredient-Grade</a> Matcha (supplements &amp; blends)<br data-w-id=\"9645a377-abdf-e46b-6549-13a65a4fa5fb\"><br data-w-id=\"ba8b7db7-83d7-4bef-4872-8cf06bd66087\">Each grade is selected based on flavor profile, color stability, and application suitability.</p>",
    "text": "We supply multiple bulk matcha grades, including:\n‍\n- Ceremonial Matcha (premium beverage applications)\n- Premium Matcha (daily latte use)\n- Culinary Matcha (high-volume food & beverage production)\n- Ingredient-Grade Matcha (supplements & blends)\n\nEach grade is selected based on flavor profile, color stability, and application suitability."
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "7c814a6e-8106-b470-bfa6-ac947f62f026",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"faq-q-text\"><strong data-w-id=\"7c814a6e-8106-b470-bfa6-ac947f62f027\">Do you offer long-term bulk supply contracts?</strong></div>",
    "text": "Do you offer long-term bulk supply contracts?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "7c814a6e-8106-b470-bfa6-ac947f62f02a",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"faq-answer-text\">Yes. We offer recurring and annual supply agreements across our available bulk matcha grades, including:<br data-w-id=\"7c814a6e-8106-b470-bfa6-ac947f62f02c\">‍<br data-w-id=\"7c814a6e-8106-b470-bfa6-ac947f62f02e\">- <a data-wf-link-page-id=\"67ffa2b15258e1b4236839cb\" data-w-id=\"7c814a6e-8106-b470-bfa6-ac947f62f030\">Ceremonial Matcha</a> (premium beverage applications)<br data-w-id=\"7c814a6e-8106-b470-bfa6-ac947f62f033\">- <a data-wf-link-page-id=\"67ffaa8d537bb69e01067ea2\" data-w-id=\"7c814a6e-8106-b470-bfa6-ac947f62f035\">Premium Matcha</a> (daily latte use)<br data-w-id=\"7c814a6e-8106-b470-bfa6-ac947f62f038\">- <a data-wf-link-page-id=\"67ffaac17dc60f8b48708801\" data-w-id=\"7c814a6e-8106-b470-bfa6-ac947f62f03a\">Culinary Matcha</a> (high-volume food &amp; beverage production)<br data-w-id=\"7c814a6e-8106-b470-bfa6-ac947f62f03d\">- <a data-wf-link-page-id=\"698ec0496e41b2e15740e98f\" data-w-id=\"7c814a6e-8106-b470-bfa6-ac947f62f03f\">Ingredient-Grade</a> Matcha (supplements &amp; blends)<br data-w-id=\"7c814a6e-8106-b470-bfa6-ac947f62f042\"><br data-w-id=\"7c814a6e-8106-b470-bfa6-ac947f62f043\">Each grade is selected based on flavor profile, color stability, and application suitability.</p>",
    "text": "Yes. We offer recurring and annual supply agreements across our available bulk matcha grades, including:\n‍\n- Ceremonial Matcha (premium beverage applications)\n- Premium Matcha (daily latte use)\n- Culinary Matcha (high-volume food & beverage production)\n- Ingredient-Grade Matcha (supplements & blends)\n\nEach grade is selected based on flavor profile, color stability, and application suitability."
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "ebf1ac19-ca97-638b-eea5-02dceb23cbb8",
   "text": {
    "html": "<h2 class=\"heading-8\">Supplying Bulk Matcha Globally</h2>",
    "text": "Supplying Bulk Matcha Globally"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "ebf1ac19-ca97-638b-eea5-02dceb23cbba",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"text-block-152\">We support food and beverage innovators with <a href=\"https://www.purematchapartners.com/blogs/match-a-making-which-matcha-grade-suits-your-needs\" data-w-id=\"ebf1ac19-ca97-638b-eea5-02dceb23cbbc\"><strong class=\"bold-text-13\" data-w-id=\"ebf1ac19-ca97-638b-eea5-02dceb23cbbd\">formulation-ready matcha</strong></a> optimized for product development. <br data-w-id=\"ebf1ac19-ca97-638b-eea5-02dceb23cbc0\">Whether you’re creating clean-label energy drinks, functional snacks, or supplement powders, our <a data-wf-link-page-id=\"67ffaac17dc60f8b48708801\" data-w-id=\"ebf1ac19-ca97-638b-eea5-02dceb23cbc2\"><strong class=\"bold-text-14\" data-w-id=\"ebf1ac19-ca97-638b-eea5-02dceb23cbc3\">ingredient-grade matcha</strong></a> delivers both flavor and functionality.<br data-w-id=\"ebf1ac19-ca97-638b-eea5-02dceb23cbc6\"><br data-w-id=\"ebf1ac19-ca97-638b-eea5-02dceb23cbc7\">We work with R&amp;D labs, co-packers, and global manufacturers to provide consistent, compliant, and scalable matcha solutions. <a class=\"link-5\" data-wf-link-page-id=\"6798bd1e4b234bad93cdab33\" data-w-id=\"ebf1ac19-ca97-638b-eea5-02dceb23cbc9\"><strong class=\"bold-text-15\" data-w-id=\"ebf1ac19-ca97-638b-eea5-02dceb23cbca\">Talk to our sourcing team</strong></a> for help selecting the right origin, grade, and format for your product.<br data-w-id=\"8568968a-5c62-171f-4f8a-a996f69fa781\"><br data-w-id=\"4f958777-8d49-cb6e-1ca8-309b05b156ee\">Supplying Bulk Matcha Globally in the <a data-wf-link-page-id=\"6991ff8c153af5609e330dad\" data-w-id=\"a9ba2e37-1c99-5437-58dc-6441610935f4\">United States</a> and the United Kingdom</div>",
    "text": "We support food and beverage innovators with formulation-ready matcha optimized for product development. \nWhether you’re creating clean-label energy drinks, functional snacks, or supplement powders, our ingredient-grade matcha delivers both flavor and functionality.\n\nWe work with R&D labs, co-packers, and global manufacturers to provide consistent, compliant, and scalable matcha solutions. Talk to our sourcing team for help selecting the right origin, grade, and format for your product.\n\nSupplying Bulk Matcha Globally in the United States and the United Kingdom"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "ea8a1a39-2a44-8ea3-feed-848f29af9a1b",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"text-size-large-4 text-weight-semibold\">Ready to get <span class=\"text-span-47\" data-w-id=\"af4300d8-917e-1505-83d8-8a5101132418\">started</span>?</div>",
    "text": "Ready to get started?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "ea8a1a39-2a44-8ea3-feed-848f29af9a1e",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"text-size-regular\">Tell us your application, target volume and destination. Our team can recommend suitable matcha grades and share relevant specifications and a tailored wholesale quote.</p>",
    "text": "Tell us your application, target volume and destination. Our team can recommend suitable matcha grades and share relevant specifications and a tailored wholesale quote."
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "7d1c9df8-6492-a852-5b12-a720beb7e75a",
   "text": {
    "html": "<a class=\"button-6\" data-wf-link-page-id=\"681dc53d385ed6f721891ace\">Request a bulk matcha quote</a>",
    "text": "Request a bulk matcha quote"
   },
